```

## Available Scripts

- `npm run dev` - Start complete development environment (pipeline + UI server)
- `npm run dev:pipeline` - Start pipeline compiler only for automatic compilation
- `npm run dev:ui` - Start UI server only (requires pipeline to be built)
- `npm run build` - Build for production (pipeline + UI)
- `npm run build:pipeline` - Build pipeline only
- `npm run generate:manifest` - Generate manifest.json from compiled pipeline
- `npm run preview` - Preview production build

